      "created_at": "2017-03-04T11:16:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How do you mean, \"the trinity\"? Three characters who are somehow \"better\" than the others, or \"most well-known\" or something? Some kind of power trio? But various heroes are part of different groups (or none at all), so how would you pick?</p>",
