      "created_at": "2017-03-04T11:56:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Based on what I remember from the letters page episodes on Legacy and Wraith: Legacy, Wraith, Bunker, and two other heroes were the original Freedom Five before Tachyon was introduced in FFA#1 which sort of rebooted that team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I believe Legacy, Wraith, and Bunker are the Big 3.</p>",
