      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-04T11:58:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only Trinity I know relating to Comics is Superman, Batman and Wonder Woman, they are the big three but I only know that because they have a comic book series called Trinity that highlights the fact that DC considers them so.</p><p>I have not heard of any other comic book company having such a concept. I don't think Sentinels has anyone who fits that bill.</p>",
