      "created_at": "2017-03-07T00:04:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's possible there wouldn't be a big three if Sentinels Comics existed. &nbsp; Based on what we know it seems the Freedom Five is the main flagship. &nbsp;There are other series on specific characters but most major events occur in the Freedom Five and Freedom Five Annuals. &nbsp;The other major comic series is Mystery Comics which also appears to have a rotating cycle on the main character. &nbsp;</p>",
