      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-11T17:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The big three really is unique to DC, because those three are so iconic and let’s face it, the rest of their characters really aren’t or at least weren’t (not to say that means they’re bad). Marvel don’t have an exact equivalent like that, so it’s a rather arbitrary number that I’m not sure I see a specific relevance to.</p>\n<p>The ones who seem to be the most recognisable, the flagship team, is certainly the Freedom Five, so let’s say them.</p>",
