      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-15T02:00:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Legacy (from Justice Comics) and Wraith (from Mystery Comics) are certainly the top two since they \"graduated\" from generic miscellany comics to flagship titles. &nbsp;Ra and Haka have a similar background (from Arcane Tales), but they never really became core series characters, so not part of a \"Trinity\" per se. &nbsp;I don't see Bunker or Tachyon as reaching the same level of any of those four in terms of the publisher's history.</p>",
